,"type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"0、空白：未通報\n1：捐精\n2：捐卵\n3：夫妻精卵","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"source of oocytes/embryos","description_en":"0. Blank: Not reported 1: Sperm donation 2: Egg donation 3: Couple's sperm and egg"},{"seq":20,"name_zh":"取卵數－含不成熟卵","name_en":"OVA_NUM","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"number of retrieved oocytes - including immature oocytes","description_en":""},{"seq":21,"name_zh":"受精卵","name_en":"ZYG","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"zygote","description_en":""},{"seq":22,"name_zh":"植入卵子數－GIFT","name_en":"EMB_OVA","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"number of implanted eggs－GIFT","description_en":""},{"seq":23,"name_zh":"胚胎受精卵植入數","name_en":"EMB_ZYG","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"embryonic fertilized egg implantation count","description_en":""},{"seq":24,"name_zh":"胚胎受精冷凍數","name_en":"E_NUM","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"frozen_embryo_number","description_en":""},{"seq":25,"name_zh":"胚胎種類","name_en":"E_TYPE","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"2005年列入通報必填項目\n0、4、5：未填答\n1：新鮮\n2：冷凍\n3：二者皆有\n空白：未通報","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"embryo type","description_en":"2005 Year Listed as Mandatory Reporting Item 0, 4, 5: Not Answered 1: Fresh 2: Frozen 3: Both Blank: Not Reported"},{"seq":26,"name_zh":"植入日期","name_en":"EMB_DATE","type":"Char","length":9,"description_zh":"民國年月日\n填寫胚胎、受精卵或精卵植入之日期；0為未植入，統計資料係以受術妻開始治療週期年度計算，因此植入年度可能會在 112年，非87-112年或數值異常者為機構誤植","available_notes":[{"roc_year":112,"ad_year":2023,"marker":""},{"roc_year":112,"ad_year":2023,"marker":""}],"name_zh_en":"Implantation Date","description_en":"YearMonthDay Embryo, fertilized egg or zygote implantation date; 0 indicates no implantation, statistical data calculated from the year of the treatment cycle when the procedure began, thus the implantation year might be 112, not between 87-112 or with abnormal values due to institutional errors"},{"seq":27,"name_zh":"卵巢過度刺激臨床症候群","name_en":"OVA_HS","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"詳譯碼說明","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"ovarian hyperstimulation clinical syndrome","description_en":"detailed translation explanation"},{"seq":28,"name_zh":"是否臨床懷孕","name_en":"C_PRE","type":"Char","length":1,"description_zh":"1：是\n0、2、3：否","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"clinical pregnancy","description_en":"1: yes; 0, 2, 3: no."},{"seq":29,"name_zh":"臨床懷孕日期","name_en":"C_PRE_DATE","type":"Char","length":9,"description_zh":"民國年月日\n填入確知是否臨床懷孕日期或因故只刺激排卵未進行取卵與因故已取卵未植入，兩種已結束治療週期之日期；統計資料係以受術妻開始治療週期年度計算，當年開始療程個案其臨床懷孕年度可能會在隔年，非87-112年或數值異常者為機構誤植","available_notes":[{"roc_year":112,"ad_year":2023,"marker":""}],"name_zh_en":"clinical pregnancy date","description_en":"ROC year-month-day\nEnter the date on which it was confirmed whether clinical pregnancy occurred, or the end date of a treatment cycle in either of two situations: ovulation was stimulated but eggs were not retrieved for some reason, or eggs were retrieved but not transferred for some reason; statistics are calculated by the year in which the wife began the treatment cycle, so for a case that began treatment in a given year, the clinical pregnancy year may fall in the following year; values outside ROC 87-112 (1998-2023) or abnormal values are institutional entry errors"},{"seq":30,"name_zh":"胚囊數","name_en":"E_SAC","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"blastocyst number","description_en":""},{"seq":31,"name_zh":"有胎心數","name_en":"F_HEART","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"Fetal Heartbeats","description_en":""},{"seq":32,"name_zh":"子宮外孕數1","name_en":"ECT_PRE","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"「是否臨床懷孕」時之子宮外孕數","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"ectopic pregnancy count 1","description_en":"Number of Ectopic Pregnancies when Clinical Pregnancy is Confirmed"},{"seq":33,"name_zh":"年齡","name_en":"AGE","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"開始使用藥物日期-受術妻出生日期","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"age","description_en":"date of drug initiation - wife's date of birth"},{"seq":34,"name_zh":"減胎數","name_en":"F_RED","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"number_of_abortions","description_en":""},{"seq":35,"name_zh":"懷孕結果日期","name_en":"END_DATE","type":"Char","length":9,"description_zh":"民國年月日\n填寫確知懷孕結果之日期；0 為無懷孕結果(未植入或未懷孕)，當年開始療程個案可能於隔年確知懷孕結果(孕期為280天)，非87-112年或數值異常者為機構誤植","available_notes":[{"roc_year":112,"ad_year":2023,"marker":""}],"name_zh_en":"pregnancy outcome date","description_en":"ROC year/month/day\nDate on which the pregnancy outcome was confirmed; 0 = no pregnancy outcome (no embryo transfer or not pregnant). For cases whose treatment started in a given year, the pregnancy outcome may be confirmed the following year (gestation is 280 days). Values outside ROC years 87-112 (1998-2023) or abnormal values are facility entry errors"},{"seq":36,"name_zh":"自然流產數","name_en":"S_ABOR","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"spontaneous abortion number","description_en":""},{"seq":37,"name_zh":"子宮外孕數2","name_en":"EE_PRE","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"「懷孕結果」時之子宮外孕數","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"ectopic pregnancy count 2","description_en":"number of ectopic pregnancies in pregnancy outcomes"},{"seq":38,"name_zh":"人工流產數","name_en":"A_ABOR","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"abortion count","description_en":""},{"seq":39,"name_zh":"死產數 20-27 週","name_en":"SB_20_27","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"stillbirths 20-27 weeks","description_en":""},{"seq":40,"name_zh":"死產數 >28 週","name_en":"SB_28","type":"Num","length":8,"description_zh":"","available_notes":[],"name_zh_en":"stillbirths >28 weeks","description_en